---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { BUSINESS, AGENT } from '../data/site';

const title = 'Privacy Policy';
const description = 'How Farnham Senior Health Advisors collects, uses, and protects your information.';
const effectiveDate = 'May 29, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <PageHero title="Privacy Policy" breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
  <section class="py-14 lg:py-18">
    <div class="container-narrow prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-crst-primary prose-a:text-crst-accent">
      <p class="text-sm text-navy-500">Effective Date: {effectiveDate}</p>
      <p>This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit this website or request information about Medicare-related insurance products and services. We are committed to protecting your privacy and handling your information in a transparent and responsible manner.</p>

      <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
      <p>This website is operated by a licensed insurance agent offering Medicare-related insurance products, including High-Deductible Medicare Supplement Insurance (Medigap), Medicare Supplement Insurance, Medicare Advantage, and Prescription Drug Plans. Offerings also include, where available, Vision, Dental, and Hospital Indemnity insurance. We are not affiliated with or endorsed by the federal government or the Medicare program.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We do not sell, share, or rent information collected on this site to others in ways different from what is disclosed on this website. Personal information includes any information that can be used to identify or contact you, such as your name, address, e-mail address, or telephone number. Information you may provide voluntarily includes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Phone number</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>ZIP code</li>
        <li>Date of birth (if provided)</li>
        <li>Information submitted through the contact form</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Please do not submit sensitive health information through this website.</strong> A licensed agent will gather any necessary personal or health-related information securely during a private consultation.</p>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to inquiries and provide Medicare plan information</li>
        <li>Contact you by phone, email, or text (with your consent)</li>
        <li>Schedule consultations</li>
        <li>Match you with appropriate insurance plan options</li>
        <li>Comply with legal and regulatory requirements</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>4. How Your Information May Be Shared</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share your information with regulatory authorities if required by law. These parties are only permitted to use your information as necessary to provide services on our behalf.</p>

      <h2>5. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your state of residence, you may have the right to request access to your personal information, request correction or deletion, opt out of certain data-sharing practices, or limit the use of sensitive personal information. To exercise these rights, please contact us using the information below.</p>

      <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable efforts to keep our users’ information secure against unauthorized access and use. We maintain physical, electronic, and procedural safeguards to guard your information.</p>

      <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our website may contain links to external sites. We are not responsible for their content or privacy practices.</p>

      <h2>8. Use of Cookies</h2>
      <p>This website does not make use of cookies.</p>

      <h2>9. Children’s Privacy</h2>
      <p>This website is not intended for individuals under age 18. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>

      <h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>We may change this privacy policy from time to time. The most current policy will be posted on this website. You are encouraged to review this policy regularly.</p>

      <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        {AGENT.name}<br />
        Phone: {BUSINESS.phone}<br />
        Email: {BUSINESS.email}<br />
        Mailing Address: {BUSINESS.mailingAddress}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
